{"Balance", "Spells", "EMP Disables Transports", "EMP normally hits special units only. On, it hits transports too. Online, the host's setting applies."},
{"Balance", "Spells", "More Than 10 Mine Spots", "A map can have up to 32 mine, quarry or well cap spots. Off: the game's own limit of 10; spots past the tenth are not usable. Stock maps have 10 or fewer, so they play the same either way. Online, the host's setting applies."},
{"Balance", "Spells", "Stunned Heroes Can Cast", "ESP and EMP normally stop a hero casting. On, a stunned hero can still cast. Online, the host's setting applies."},
{"Balance", "Spells", "Fix Hotwired Healing", "Heal normally skips hotwired units. On, it heals them too. Online, the host's setting applies."},
{"Balance", "Spells", "AI Uses Targeted Spells", "Computer heroes also cast spells aimed at a unit (damage, boosts, Hotwire, EMP), not just area and self spells. Not online."},
